    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "是ハ豐橋藩ゟ請取以前ニ付受取濟之儀伺中之由申送有之未引渡無之候"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "これは豊橋藩より請け取り以前につき、受取済みの儀伺い中の由、申し送りこれ有り、未だ引き渡しこれ無く候"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Warichu (two-column interlinear) note on the 外 figure: \"This is land prior to receipt from Toyohashi Domain. Word has been sent that an inquiry is pending as to whether receipt has been completed; the transfer has not yet taken place.\" Explains why the 538.81 koku is entered outside the main assessment."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "外高割註（豐橋藩引渡未濟）（靜岡藩分）"
